sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Traveler
    participant JS as Frontend Controller (planner.js)
    participant Ctrl as PlannerController
    participant Serv as PlannerService
    participant Repo as PlaceRepository
    participant AI as PlannerAiService
    participant DB as MySQL Database

    User ->> JS: Submit Preferences Form
    JS ->> Ctrl: POST /api/planner/generate (Request)
    Ctrl ->> Serv: generate(PlannerRequest)
    
    Serv ->> Repo: smartFilter(preferences, minRating)
    Repo ->> DB: SQL SELECT query
    DB -->> Repo: Return matching rows
    Repo -->> Serv: List~Place~
    
    alt Sparse Coverage (< days * 2 places)
        Serv ->> Serv: Expand with nearby region places
    end
    
    alt AI Generation Path
        Serv ->> AI: generateFallbackItinerary(Request, City, Days, ...)
        AI ->> AI: Call OpenRouter API via HTTP POST
        AI -->> Serv: Return AiFallbackResult (Success)
    else AI Disabled or Failed Path
        Serv ->> Serv: Run Rule-Based Proximity Scheduling Fallback
    end
    
    Serv -->> Ctrl: PlannerResponseDto
    Ctrl -->> JS: HTTP 200 OK (Response JSON)
    JS ->> User: Render Interactive Trip View
